<title>JAPAN: Hoya Corp down on profit taking.</title>
<headline>Hoya Corp down on profit taking.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in optical glass maker Hoya Corp slipped for a fourth consecutive day on Wednesday on profit taking, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0200 GMT, the share was down 130 yen at 5,550. Its volume was 225,000 shares.  </p>
<p>&quot;Hoya has attracted foreign investors as a blue-chip issue, but some are switching their positions to other blue chips that are moving more actively,&quot; said a trader at a second-tier Japanese securities house.</p>
</text>
